1
00:00:00,268 --> 00:00:01,308
(Howard:)Unless Sheldon's there.

2
00:00:01,477 --> 00:00:06,187
(Howard:)You'll be trapped forever
in his whiny, hyper-neurotic snot web.

3
00:00:13,823 --> 00:00:15,573
Hi, Penny?

4
00:00:15,742 --> 00:00:19,162
I was just wondering,
is Sheldon still at the restaurant?

5
00:00:20,663 --> 00:00:23,253
(Leonard(Dials phone):)Okay, that was very nice of you.
Okay, I gotta go.

6
00:00:23,416 --> 00:00:26,706
Got kind of a full-blown
Chernobyl thing here. Gotta go, bye.

7
00:00:28,004 --> 00:00:29,424
(Leonard(Dials phone):)He's home. I'm screwed.

8
00:00:32,175 --> 00:00:35,765
(Leonard(Dials phone):)Ten and a half hours of apey blurriness.

9
00:00:36,679 --> 00:00:38,469
How about Lasik?

10
00:00:39,599 --> 00:00:42,599
- You want me to get eye surgery?
- Would you rather go back...

11
00:00:42,769 --> 00:00:46,899
(Raj:)...and deal with Sheldon or have a stranger
carve out your corneas with a laser beam?

12
00:00:49,275 --> 00:00:51,405
- Well?
- I'm thinking.

13
00:00:52,904 --> 00:00:55,994
Okay, nice and cozy.

14
00:00:56,407 --> 00:01:00,027
(Penny:)- Okay, I'll see you later.
- Wait.

